{"id":"A1-L058","title":"Key verb: give","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U04","focus":"Verbo-chave: give","targets":{"grammar":"Verbo-chave: give","pron":"/h/ de house","verbs":[],"pv":["put on"],"expr":[],"words":["gift","scarf","purchase","service","clerk","try","wrap","ribbon","gift box","exchange","refund","birthday card","price tag","gift tag"],"field":"Moradia","genre":"Resenha / review","skill":"Escrita","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 58 · Key verb: give","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Verbo-chave: give.","**Phrasal verbs:** put on.","**Pronúncia:** /h/ de house.","**14 palavras novas** (moradia).","**Texto do dia:** resenha / review."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo usar give em pedidos e presentes e usar put on."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **escrever frases claras e corretas (IELTS Writing, TOEFL Writing)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["gift","presente"],["scarf","cachecol"],["purchase","compra"],["service","atendimento"],["clerk","balconista"],["try","tentar"],["wrap","wrap"],["ribbon","ribbon"],["gift box","gift box"],["exchange","exchange"],["refund","refund"],["birthday card","birthday card"],["price tag","price tag"],["gift tag","gift tag"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A review","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Review: The Gift Shop ★★★★☆","paras":["This shop **gives** great service. The clerk **gives** you a free bag with every purchase and **gives** advice on gifts.","I **gave** (give) my mother a scarf. She **puts on** the scarf every morning!","Prices are fair. **Give** it a try."],"kicker":"SHOP REVIEW","by":"Mia, 4 stars","gloss":[["gift","presente"],["scarf","cachecol"],["purchase","compra"],["try","tentar"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The shop gives a free bag.","ans":"T","why":"“free bag.”"},{"q":"The shop is expensive.","ans":"F","why":"“Prices are fair.”"},{"q":"Mia’s mother wears the scarf.","ans":"T","why":"“puts on the scarf.”"},{"q":"The shop is open on Sunday.","ans":"NG","why":"Não diz."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“scarf” means…","opts":["cachecol","chapéu","luva"],"ans":0,"why":"scarf = cachecol."},{"q":"“purchase” means…","opts":["compra","venda","troca"],"ans":0,"why":"purchase = compra."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Key verb: give","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Sentido","Exemplo"],"rows":[["dar","**Give me the book.**"],["dar (presente)","**I give her a gift.**"],["dar conselho","**He gives advice.**"],["give up","**Don’t give up!**"],["give back","**Give it back.**"]],"cap":"Give"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Estrutura","body":"**give + pessoa + coisa**: *Give **me** the key.* ou **give + coisa + to + pessoa**: *Give the key **to me**.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"Please ___ me the key. (give)","a":"give","why":"give.","say":"Give me the key"},{"s":"The clerk ___ you a bag. (give)","a":"gives","why":"clerk → gives."},{"s":"She ___ the scarf every day. (put on)","a":"puts on","why":"put on."},{"s":"Don’t ___ up! (give)","a":"give","why":"give up."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["gift","presente"],["scarf","cachecol"],["purchase","compra"],["service","atendimento"],["clerk","balconista"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["her","a","scarf","Give"],"ans":"Give her a scarf","pt":"Dê um cachecol."},{"words":["I","give","you","a","bag","Can"],"ans":"Can I give you a bag","pt":"Posso lhe dar uma sacola?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"gift","pos":"noun","pt":"presente","ex":"A nice gift.","expt":"Um bom presente."},{"w":"scarf","pos":"noun","pt":"cachecol","ex":"A red scarf.","expt":"Um cachecol vermelho."},{"w":"purchase","pos":"noun","pt":"compra","ex":"A small purchase.","expt":"Uma compra pequena."},{"w":"service","pos":"noun","pt":"atendimento","ex":"Good service.","expt":"Bom atendimento."},{"w":"clerk","pos":"noun","pt":"balconista","ex":"A kind clerk.","expt":"Um balconista gentil."},{"w":"try","pos":"verb","pt":"tentar","ex":"Give it a try.","expt":"Experimente."},{"w":"wrap","pos":"word","pt":"wrap","ex":"embrulhar","expt":"Wrap the gift."},{"w":"ribbon","pos":"word","pt":"ribbon","ex":"fita","expt":"A red ribbon."},{"w":"gift box","pos":"word","pt":"gift box","ex":"caixa de presente","expt":"A small gift box."},{"w":"exchange","pos":"word","pt":"exchange","ex":"trocar","expt":"Exchange it."},{"w":"refund","pos":"word","pt":"refund","ex":"reembolso","expt":"Ask for a refund."},{"w":"birthday card","pos":"word","pt":"birthday card","ex":"cartão de aniversário","expt":"A birthday card."},{"w":"price tag","pos":"word","pt":"price tag","ex":"etiqueta de preço","expt":"Remove the price tag."},{"w":"gift tag","pos":"word","pt":"gift tag","ex":"etiqueta de presente","expt":"Write on the gift tag."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Can I give you a bag?** — Posso lhe dar uma sacola?","**Yes, please.** — Sim, por favor.","**Give her a scarf.** — Dê um cachecol.","**It’s the thought that counts.** — O que vale é a intenção.","**Do you gift wrap?** — Vocês embrulham para presente?","**I’ll take it.** — Vou levar."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"give","pt":"dar","forms":[["I give","I give gifts."],["you give","You give advice."],["he / she / it gives","She gives me a bag."],["we / they give","